title: An Outsider Enters the Race
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 2015 and month >= 6 and trump_checked = 0
priority: 400
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: trump_active = 1 if maga_strength >= 29

= An Outsider Enters the Race

[? if maga_strength >= 29 : A brash outsider has entered the Republican primary, with no political experience, a talent for television, and a message about trade, immigration, and elites that resonates with millions of disaffected voters. The Republican establishment is horrified, and polls are not reassuring. ?][? if maga_strength < 29 : A handful of political outsiders have entered the Republican primary. The anti-establishment mood is real, but the movement lacks a champion capable of breaking through. ?]

How seriously do we take this?

- @outsider_serious: Take the threat seriously
- @outsider_laugh: Treat it as a sideshow
- @outsider_grievances: Engage with the grievances

@outsider_serious
on-arrival: trump_urgency += 1.5; trump_checked = 1; dem_enthusiasm += 0.3; pro_democracy += 0.5; maga_strength -= 0.5

We start preparing early, in case the outsider breaks through.

@outsider_laugh
on-arrival: trump_checked = 1; trump_urgency -= 0.3; maga_strength += 1

We treat the whole thing as a joke. Some of us will regret it.

@outsider_grievances
on-arrival: trump_checked = 1; trump_urgency += 0.5; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 2*(1-dissent); populist_strength += 2; maga_strength -= 1.5

We study why the message resonates and adjust our economic pitch.
